Styler compiles its domain workflows to a PipeCraft 1.3.1-compatible plan model
in Python. Styler extends that contract with Linux-specific concurrent resource
scheduling, persistent resume, system executors, effect receipts and separately
compiled Apply and Undo DAGs. The PipeCraft Rust binary is not bundled or
required by this release.
